# Stradivarius violin search results — compiled for buyability

**As of:** 2026-05-18 (UTC)  
**Method:** Public web index search (not exhaustive of the whole internet). Prices, availability, and URLs change; verify before purchase. “Stradivarius” labels on mass-market instruments are usually **copies**, not Cremona originals by Antonio Stradivari.

---

## 1) Authentic instruments — channels where one can buy (auction, private sale, dealer inquiry)

| Item / channel | Notes | URL |
|----------------|-------|-----|
| **1731 “Heifetz, Piel” Stradivari** | Tarisio **Private Sales**; news coverage indicated sale process in **spring 2025** — contact Tarisio for current status/price (not a fixed “Add to cart”). | https://tarisio.com/heifetz/ |
| **Tarisio** (auctions + private sales) | Primary market for fine violins including Stradivari; check current catalog and private-sale desk. | https://tarisio.com/ |
| **Sotheby’s — “Joachim–Ma” (1714)** | **Past** dedicated sale (Feb 2025); lot/estimate pages may still resolve — confirm if any post-auction arrangement remains. | https://www.sothebys.com/en/buy/auction/2025/the-joachim-ma-stradivarius-a-masterpiece-of-sound/antonio-stradivari-the-joachim-ma-violin |
| **Christie’s** (past notable lots) | **Hammer** (1707), **Hellier** (1679), **Solomon** (1729), etc. — historical lot pages; use for provenance research; watch **upcoming** fine-instrument sales. | https://www.christies.com/en/lot/lot-746329 (example 1728 lot page from results) |
| **Bonhams** | Past offering example: Stradivari **1700** (Nov 2003 sale page in archive). | https://www.bonhams.com/auction/10489/lot/115/an-important-violin-by-antonio-stradivari-cremona-1700/ |
| **J & A Beare** | Major London dealer; notable Stradivari sales and market data (no single public “buy now” inventory URL guaranteed). | https://www.beares.com/notable-sales/ |
| **Darnton & Hersh** | Chicago dealer; publishes features on specific Stradivari (e.g. ex-Vieuxtemps 1710 page from search). | https://darntonhersh.com/a-violin-by-antonio-stradivari/ |
| **Ingles & Hayday** | Notable sales pages; upcoming auctions mentioned in secondary sources — verify calendar on their site. | https://ingleshayday.com/notable-sales-instrument/a-violin-by-antonio-stradivari-18/ |

**Contact cited for Heifetz Strad sale:** `heifetz@tarisio.com` (from public reporting; re-verify on Tarisio’s official page.)

